    <div class="tamu-about-body__intro">
      <h2>Explore collections by collecting area</h2>
      <p>Texas A&M Digital Collections contains digitized versions of items from across Cushing's various collecting areas.</p> 
      <p>For more information about the scope of each collecting area, read at our <a href="https://library.tamu.edu/cushing/about/cushing-policies/collection-policies/index.html">Collecting Policies</a>.</p>
